Package: cardsvariance
Title: Variance Analysis and Validation of Card Payments Regulatory Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Sandilands", , "msand91@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny application and supporting functions for
    pre-submission validation of card payments statistics:
    period-on-period variance analysis, seasonal adjustment and anomaly
    detection with 'timetk', hierarchy and cross-return reconciliation
    rules, and value/volume bridge analysis.
